@665e0,

To be honest, after engaging with various perspectives on Twitter, including yours and 6833D's comments, I must admit that my viewpoint on the matter has slightly shifted. I initially believed (and continue to somewhat lean towards) the notion that The United States’ involvement in the global economy is indeed a net negative due to its potential consequences such as lowering domestic wages and costing US jobs.

